sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer / Guest
    participant Frontend as Frontend UI (React)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Engine as Booking Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant Ledger as Ledger Service
    actor Admin as Admin Operator

    %% Section 1: Customer Booking Flow
    Note over Customer, DB: 1. Booking Creation & Concurrency Hold
    Customer->>Frontend: Browse Venue & Select Slot/Unit
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/v1/bookings (inventory_unit_id, details)
    API->>Engine: create_booking(inventory_unit_id)
    Engine->>DB: SELECT unit FOR UPDATE (Lock slot row)
    alt Slot is Available
        Engine->>DB: INSERT into bookings (status='pending_payment')
        Engine->>DB: UPDATE inventory_units SET status='held' (expires in 10m)
        Engine->>DB: INSERT into booking_events (action='created')
        Engine-->>API: (Booking, raw_manage_token if guest)
        API-->>Frontend: 201 Created (Booking details, expires_in=600s)
        Frontend-->>Customer: Show Review & Pay Screen (Countdown Timer)
    else Slot Already Held or Booked
        Engine-->>API: 409 Conflict ("Unit already held or booked")
        API-->>Frontend: Error Response
        Frontend-->>Customer: Display "Slot unavailable" Alert
    end

    %% Section 2: Offline Payment & Confirmation
    Note over Customer, Admin: 2. Offline Payment & Admin Confirmation
    Customer->>Customer: Completes Bank Transfer / UPI Offline
    Admin->>Frontend: Open Admin Bookings Tab
    Admin->>API: POST /api/v1/admin/bookings/{id}/confirm-payment
    API->>Engine: confirm_booking_by_admin(booking_id)
    Engine->>DB: UPDATE bookings SET status='confirmed'
    Engine->>DB: UPDATE inventory_units SET status='booked'
    Engine->>DB: INSERT into payments (amount, commission, status='succeeded')
    Engine->>Ledger: record_payment_confirmation()
    Ledger->>DB: INSERT ledger_entries (Debit customer_funds_held, Credit owner_payable, Credit platform_commission)
    Engine->>DB: INSERT into outbox_events (type='booking_confirmed')
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK (Booking Confirmed)
    Frontend-->>Admin: Show Green Confirmed Status

    %% Section 3: Customer Cancellation & Tiered Refund
    Note over Customer, Ledger: 3. Customer Cancellation & Automated Refund
    Customer->>Frontend: Click "Cancel Booking" in My Bookings
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/cancel
    API->>Engine: cancel_booking_as_customer()
    Engine->>Engine: Calculate Proximity to Slot Start Time
    alt Hours >= 48 Hours
        Note over Engine: Full Refund Tier (100% refund, 0% penalty)
    else Hours >= 24 Hours
        Note over Engine: Partial Refund Tier (50% refund, 50% penalty)
    else Hours < 24 Hours
        Note over Engine: No Refund Tier (0% refund, 100% penalty)
    end
    Engine->>DB: UPDATE bookings SET status='cancelled'
    Engine->>DB: UPDATE inventory_units SET status='available'
    Engine->>DB: INSERT into refunds (amount, refund_tier, status='completed')
    Engine->>Ledger: record_refund()
    Ledger->>DB: INSERT ledger_entries (Balanced debit/credit reversal)
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK (Refund tier & amount)
    Frontend-->>Customer: Show Toast ("Booking cancelled. Refund: XX%")
